  "verseCount": 63,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemu tori omwegenwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha asende, riganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, manyia Yerusalemu okogechia kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teebia Yerusalemu ng’a aya naro Omonene akoyoteebia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Aye nigo kwaiboreretwe ase ense ya Kaanani. Iso nigo arenge Omoamori, na nyoko n’Omohiti orenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko kwaiboretwe ororera rwao tirwanachetwe, gose tigwasibetigwe namaache orabe, gose tikwaagetwe omonyoo, gose tikwabeekeretwe eanga y’obwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monto onde takororerete amabeebe agokorere ring’ana nonya n’erimo ase ayio, gose gokororera amaabera; korende nigo gwatugutetwe isiko aarabu, ekiagera rituko erio kwaiboretwe nigo kwangetwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero naetete agwo ase kwarenge, ngakorora gokwegara‐garia ime ase amanyinga ao, nkagoteebia: Buna oraire ase amanyinga ao ime, obe moyo; ee, nkagoteebia: Buna oraire ase amanyinga ao ime, obe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkagokiinia okamenteka okaba chilifu ne chilifu, buna ebimeri bire ase riroba. Ogakiina okaba omonene na omonyakieni: chimbeere chiao chigakina, na etukia yao boigo; korende nonya naboigo, nigo kwarenge getirianda, tikwabegete kende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero naende naetete ase ore, ngakorigereria, nkarora ng’a gwaikire engaki y’ogwanchwa. Nkagotuba nomwambaro one, nkabisia obogetirianda bwao. Naende ngakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania naye, erio aye okaba oy’one. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erio nkagosibia n’amaache, ngasibia amanyinga ao onsi na kogoaka amaguta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakobekera eanga eroisirie ere nebieni ao ao, ngakobekera na ebikoroto bie risankwa riterere ri’eng’iti ya rooche. Ngakoboyia egetambaa ki’egatani engiya, naende ngakobekera egietubo ki’ariri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkagochabera n’ebinto bi’obwari, na ase amaboko ao ngakobekera chibangiri, ne chisonoi ase rigoti ria’o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabeka ebonyi ase emioro yao, na ebigera ase amato ao, na eguutwa enseera ase omotwe oo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aye ogaachaberwa ne chitaabu, ne chifeta, ne chianga chiao nigo chiarenge echi’egatani engiya, na echi’ariri, na echiroisirie chire nebieni ao ao. Boigo okaria endagera yaroiseretigwe nobosie obonuke, na okaria obooke, na amaguta. Erio okaba omonyakieni mono, ogasesenigwa, ogaikera ekerengo ki’oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okamanyekana ase ebisaku ase engencho y’oboseera bwao. Oboseera bwao nigo bwarenge oboikeranu, ekiagera ninche nakoboete.” Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende aye nigo gwasemeretie oboseera bwao, erio ogekora omotaayayi, ekiagera kwamanyekanete mono, ogekaayayia ase abaeti bonsi, ogechwara ase onde bwensi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okaira chianga chiao, ogaachabera aase aimokererete igoro akaba nebieni ao ao, na aroro agwo ogakorera obonyaka bwao. Amang’ana anga buna ayio tana gokorekana korwa kare, na tagokorekana aande nonya ng’ake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende okaimokia ebinto biao ebiya bie chitaabu na ebie chifeta nakoete, erio okeroiseria emegwekano yogosasiima enga abasacha, erio ogakora obonyaka n’ero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende okaira chianga chiao chiare n’ebieni ao ao, ogatuba emegwekano eria, na okabeka amaguta ane na ubani y’ane ase amasio abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omogati one nakoete, na obosie obonuke, na amaguta amaya, na obooke, ebio okabirua ase emegwekano eyio koba rimisu rigiya rikoyegwenera; ee, nabo gwakorete.” Nab’Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende okaira abana bao, abamura na abaiseke, abwo kwanyiborerete, okabarua bakaba ebing’wanso ase emegwekano eyio, okabasiria. Inee! Obonyaka obwo bwao ne ring’ana riike?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nering’ana riike aye kwaruete abana bane bakaba ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa ase emegwekano eyio?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio kwarenge gokora ebibe bi’okogechia, na obotaayayi, tikwainyorete amatuko aria y’oboke bwao, ekero kwarenge getirianda otabegete kende, na kwarenge kwegaragaria ime ase amanyinga ao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obogima bwa Yerusalemu bw’obonyaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene nigo agoteeba iga, “Obobe nobwao! Magega kogwakorire amabe aya onsi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okeagachera ebinyomba bi’emegwekano ogosasiima, na ase kera enchera kwaagachire aase aimokererete igoro ogosasiimera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase kera amatabekania ye chinchera kwaagachire aase aimokererete igoro ogosasiimera, kwanyakairie oboseera bwao, gwechwarire ase onde bwensi ogoeta, na gwakorire obonyaka obonge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo gwakorete obonyaka n’Abamisiri, abanto abwo mosinyaine bare nokogania okobe; okamenta obonyaka bwao, na okagera nkagechigwa nkaba n’endamwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rora, naramboire okoboko kw’ane kogoaka, nakeeirie endagera yao, naende nakorure nakobekire ase abakungu b’Abafilisti, abwo bakogechete naende barorire obosooku ase ogokora kwao kw’obonyaka, erinde bagokorere buna banchete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende ngwakorete obonyaka n’Abaasuri, ekiagera tigwaisanegete, ee, ngwakorete obotaayayi nabarabwo, nonya naboigo tigwaisanegete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkwamentete obotaayayi bwao, okagenda nonya ngochia ase ense y’Abakalidayo, abwo bare abaonchoreria, na barabwo boigo tibagoisanegetie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo agoteeba iga: “Naki enkoro yao ere nokogania okonene kw’ogwanchwa, ekiagera gwakorire aya onsi, ayare buna ogokora kw’omokuungu omonyaka otari korora obosooku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweagacheire ebinyomba bi’emegwekano ogosasiima ase amatabekania onsi ye chinchera, na ase kera enchera kwaagachire aase aimokererete igoro ogosasimera. Nonya naboigo tikwarenge buna omokungu omotaayayi onde bwensi, ekiagera nigo gwachaayete ogoakanerwa gwe chitaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omokungu omotomani nigo gwatigete omosacha oo okaba kore nabasaacha abaao!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasacha nigo bakorwa chitaabu baa abakungu abatayayi, korende aye nigo okorua echiao kwaa abanchi bao ase okobaebereria bache korwa chinsemo chionsi bakore obonyaka naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nigo ore nogwatananeka korwa ase abakungu bande abatayayi. Monto onde tagotuny’anete arigie gokora obonyaka naye, korende naye omonyene kwaruete chitaabu ase obonyaka obwo. Ase ayio nigo ore nogwatananeka korwa ase abatayayi bande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egesusuro kia Nyasae ase Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio, aye omotayayi, igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Obosooku bwao bwaorokigwe isiko, na obogetirianda bwao tibotubiri ekero ogokora obonyaka nabanchi bao. Naende nigo gwasasimete emegwekano yao y’okogechia na okarua abana bao bakaba ekeng’wanso ase emegwekano eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio ninsangererie abanchi bao abwo kwegokeretie, na bonsi abwo gwanchete, na abwo kwageechete; nimbasangererie korwa ase chinsemo chionsi bagoetanane, ngwasiorie, erinde barore obogetirianda bwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkonachere ekiina buna abakungu basaririe chiira chi’okonyuomana kwabo na buna abaiteri amanyinga bakonacherwa ekiina; amanyinga ao ninyaitere inde nendamwamu ne risemi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkobeke ase amaboko ’abanchi bao; barabwo mbatagore ebinyomba biria kweagacherete bi’emegwekano ogosasiima amo nase ao aimokererete igoro. Naende mbakorusie chianga chiao, na baire ebinto biao ebiya bi’ogwechabera, bagotige kore getirianda otabegeti eanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abwo mbagochere amo nomoganda omonene, bagoake amagena na gokobutorana nemioro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbasambe chinyomba chiao, naende bakonachere ekiina ase amasio ’abakuungu abange. Ningotange tokora obonyaka, na tokogenderera korua chitaabu ase obonyaka naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase enchera eyio ning’isanekie endamwamu y’ane ase ore, ne risemi riane ndirue ase ore, erio nario ndabe n’obotoereru, gose tinkogechigwa naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiagera otainyorete amatuko aria ay’oboke bwao, korende kwabeire gokongechia nogokora kwao gwonsi, rora, ningoakane ogokora kwao gokoiranere, na igo togokora ogokora okwo kw’obosooku gokomenta ase ebibe binde bi’okogechia gwakorire.” Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buna ng’ina omosubati are, nabo nomosubati oye are",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rora, omonto onde bwensi oganetie gokwana omoreng’anio, nigo arakwane igoro yao, atebe: Buna ng’ina omosubati are, nabo nomosubati oye are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omosubati nigo onga nyoko, oria bwangete omosacha oye, na abana baye; naende nigo onga basubati bamino, abwo bangete abasacha babo, na abana babo. Nyoko nigo arenge Omohiti na iso n’Omoamiori orenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mosubati omino omonene nere Samaria, oyio omenyete amo nabaiseke baye ensemo yao ya sugusu, na mosubati omino omoke nere Sodomu, oyio omenyete amo nabaiseke baye ensemo ya Irianyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye tigwaisanegete ase okobwatia chinchera chiabo, gose aria gwakorete koreng’ana nokogechia kwabo, korende ase engaki enke yoka aye ogakora ayare amabe kobua ayabo, ase chinchera chiao chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonene Nyasae nigo agoteeba iga: Ekeene, buna inche inde moyo, Sodomu, mosubati omino, na abaiseke baye, tibarakora buna aye gwakorire amo nabaiseke bao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naama! Ebi nabio biarenge ebibe bia Sodomu, mosubati omino: Ere amo nabaiseke baye nigo barenge abaenenu na abaigotu b’endagera, naende nigo barenge n’obotoereru, korende tibechanderete abataka na abaremerwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo barenge abamwenu, na bakaba bagokora ay’okogechia ase obosio bwane, Ase ayio, ekero narooche amang’ana ayio, nigo nabarusetieo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Samaria tiyakorete ebibe, nonya nekeng’ese kereng’aine ebiao; aye gwakorire ebibe ebinge bi’okogechia kobua emechie eyio. Ase engencho eyio kwagerire basubati bamino barorekanire bare abanyaboronge, ekero ebibe biao bikoreng’anigwa nebiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono aye bogoria obosooku bwao bw’ogochaaywa, ekiagera kwagerire basubati bamino banyorire obotamero. Ebibe biao bi’okogechia biabeire ebinge kobua ebiabo; bono barabwo nigo bakororekana ng’a nabanyaboronge bare gokobua. Ase ayio, kabe nobosooku bw’ogochaaywa, ekiagera kwagerire basubati bamino barorekanire bare abanyaboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sodomu na Samaria neiranerigwe amaya abo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inche ninsibore abasibwa b’emechie eye: abasibwa ba Sodomu amo nab’abaiseke baye, na Abasamaria amo nab’abaiseke baye. Boigo naye Yerusalemu ningosibore kore ase egati yabo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erinde obogorie ogochaaywa kwao orore obosooku ase engencho y’ayio onsi gwakorire, na ase enchera eyio nobaretere okoremia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro arabe ase abasubati bamino: Sodomu na abaiseke baye nabairanerigwe amaya abo, babe buna barenge ritang’ani, na Samaria na abaiseke baye mbairanerigwe amaya abo, babe buna barenge ritang’ani. Naye boigo na abaiseke bao moiranerigwe amaya aino, mobe buna mwarenge ritang’ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Sodomu, mosubati omino, tabeete omobayeeno kwarenge gokwana ase okomochaaya, ekero kwarenge noboenenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero keria ebibe biao konya bitaraorokigwa maiso marore? Bono kwabeire buna ere. Abaiseke b’ense ya Edomu, na ab’Abafilisti, abwo bagoetanaine ase chinsemo chiao chionsi, nigo bagochaayete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono goika obogorie egesusuro ki’ogokora kwao okobe, na okogechia kwao gwonsi.” Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.58"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okobwatana kw’ogotianania nkogenderere goika kare na kare",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Ningokorere koreng’ana buna gwakorire, ekiagera gwachaayire eira gwatianete, na gwasaririe okobwatana kw’ogotianania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya naboigo ning’inyore okobwatana kw’ogotianania nakorete naye ase amatuko aria y’obobe bwao, ninkore naye okobwatana kw’ogotianania koragenderere goika kare na kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio aye oinyore ogokora kwao obe nobosooku, ekero oraire basubati bamino abanene na abake. Ninkobae babe abaiseke bao, korende tari ase engencho y’okobwatana kw’ane kw’ogotianania koria nakorete naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkong’ie okobwatana kwane kw’ogotianania koria nakorete naye; erio nario oramanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ’ndabe nakwabeire aya onsi gwakorire, aye noyainyore erinde oumate okirekiri, tomumora omonwa oo, ase engencho y’obosooku bwao. Nabo Omonene ateebire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.63"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
